Spec: Retrail

Platform: Flutter/Dart/Material 3/Riverpod/Drift/MapLibre

Purpose:
  GPS route tracker for skate and snow rides on Android and iOS: skate in summer (skateboard,
    longboard and the other wheel sports), snow in winter (snowboard and ski), and any other board
    or wheel sport. Migrated from an Android Jetpack Compose app. Records rides offline, keeps a
    history with pre-rendered map previews, and lets a rider follow a saved route again.

Structure:
  ./lib: Flutter app code
  ./test: Unit, widget, provider, DAO, golden and scenario tests
  ./integration_test: On-device integration tests
  ./android: Android host app, service notification, platform channels, release signing
  ./ios: iOS host app, Live Activity extension, platform channels
  ./assets: Map styles, app icon and activity icons
  ./tool: Build, release, map-style and store-graphics scripts
  ./store: Play Store listing texts, screenshots and graphics
  ./docs: Release, store and sideloading guides; decision notes; spec history

Owns:
  ./pubspec.yaml
  ./pubspec.lock
  ./analysis_options.yaml
  ./l10n.yaml
  ./README.md
  ./LICENSE
  ./AGENTS.md
  ./CLAUDE.md
  ./.gitignore
  ./.metadata
  ./.mcp.json
  ./.ignore
  ./android/.gitignore
  ./ios/.gitignore
  ./.git-blame-ignore-revs
  ./.githooks/pre-commit
  ./.githooks/pre-push
  ./.github/workflows/ios-build.yml
  ./integration_test
  ./docs

References:
  /docs/specs/history/01-foundation.md
  /docs/specs/history/15-polish-release.md

Depends on:
  `flutter_riverpod`: state management, providers written by hand
  `drift`: SQLite persistence with reactive streams
  `shared_preferences`: preferences behind @PreferencesRepository
  `maplibre`: native live map
  `vector_tile_renderer`: preview tiles drawn in Dart
  `geolocator`: location and iOS background location
  `flutter_foreground_task`: Android foreground service and notification
  `audioplayers`: countdown clips (bundled audio, no system voice)
  `vibration`: countdown buzz
  `image_picker`: profile photo source
  `image_cropper`: profile photo crop
  `go_router`: routing
  `flutter_localizations`: ARB localization with `intl`
  `mocktail`: test doubles

Must:
  Every behaviour of the original Android app is kept: distances, speeds, filters, formatting,
    GPS filtering thresholds and offline handling. The one deliberate improvement is pre-rendered,
    cached ride previews.
  App ID is `io.github.valijuu.retrail` on Android and iOS; debug builds add `.debug` and are
    labelled `Retrail Debug`.
  The repository stays public with all rights reserved.

Must not:
  Contain real ride or GPS data; real traces stay in gitignored fixtures.
  Contain release bundles, signing keys or `android/key.properties`.
